Description: command-line kernel management backend for MiniOS
 minios-kernel packages, installs, activates, lists, and removes MiniOS kernel
 bundles from the command line. It provides the non-graphical kernel management
 backend used by MiniOS Kernel Manager and can also be used directly from a
 terminal or automation.

Package: minios-kernel-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         minios-kernel (= ${binary:Version}),
         polkitd | policykit-1,
         pkexec | policykit-1,
         python3 (>= 3.6),
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
