         gir1.2-gdk-3.0,
         gir1.2-pango-1.0,
         python3-minios-gui (>= 1.4.0)
Description: graphical kernel manager for MiniOS
 MiniOS Kernel Manager is the GTK3 frontend for the minios-kernel command-line
 backend. It provides graphical workflows for browsing, packaging, activating,
 and removing MiniOS kernel bundles while keeping privileged kernel operations
 behind the standalone CLI interface.
